OL,3,AEx-England footballer Raheem Sterling
OL,4,Ato be sentenced for dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FSterling pleaded guilty to driving the
OL,7,Fcar dangerously on the M3, the M25, the
OL,8,FA327 and Minley Road - he also admitted
OL,9,Fpossessing nitrous oxide, a Class C
OL,10,Fdrug, for wrongful inhalation and
OL,11,Ffailing to provide a specimen for
OL,12,Fanalysis
OL,14,FThe footballer has 82 England caps, the
OL,15,Flast of which was won at the 2022 World
OL,16,FCup in Qatar
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
